Storybook-only addition on branch `feature/SFCC-236_product-card-shared-component` in `/Users/marcel.a.n.navarro/Dev/zimmermann-pwa`, approved by Marcel. Two new story exports, no changes to any existing story or to any component logic.

**File:** `overrides/app/components/ui-kits/molecules/zimmProductCardContent/index.stories.tsx` — read it in full first (it's short, ~128 lines) to match its exact conventions.

**Add story 1 — `WithAttributesOneSize`**, placed directly after the existing `WithAttributes` story. Same shape as `WithAttributes` (`...Default.args, showAttributes: true, colour: 'Ivory'`), but with `size: 'One size'` instead of `size: 'M'` — demonstrating the wishlist-style colour/size attribute line for a one-size product. Give it a one-line doc comment in this file's own style (e.g. `/** Wishlist-shaped, one-size product: the size half of the attributes line reads "One size" rather than a real size value. */`).

**Add story 2 — `WithSizeChipsOneSize`**, placed directly after the existing `WithSizeChips` story. This one needs to trigger `ZimmSizeChipGroup`'s own single-value branch (a static, non-interactive "One size" label — not the multi-chip radiogroup `WithSizeChips` shows). Use:
```ts
export const WithSizeChipsOneSize: Story = {
  args: {
    ...Default.args,
    showSizeChips: true,
    sizeChipValues: [{ value: 'os', label: 'One size' }],
  },
};
```
Do **not** wrap this one in `WithSizeChipsExample` and do **not** pass `selectedSizeChipValue`/`onSizeChipSelect` — the single-value branch this triggers is genuinely non-interactive (a plain bordered label, not a radiogroup), so there's nothing to select and no live-state wrapper is needed; giving it the interactive wrapper or those props would be misleading, implying interactivity that doesn't exist for this case. Confirm this yourself by reading `ZimmSizeChipGroup`'s own `index.tsx` (`values.length === 1` branch) before writing the story, don't just take this description on faith. Give it a doc comment explaining why it's plain args, not the interactive wrapper (e.g. referencing the `values.length === 1` non-interactive branch).

**Do not touch** `Default`, `WithAttributes`, `WithSizeChips`, `WithSizeChipsExample`, `Unavailable`, `LoadingPrice`, the `meta` object, or anything else in this file.

When done, report the exact new code for both stories, confirm `npx tsc --noEmit` is clean, and confirm `npx vitest run` finds no test regressions relevant to this file (stories aren't executed by Vitest, but run `overrides/app/components/ui-kits/molecules/zimmProductCardContent/index.test.tsx` to be sure nothing else broke). Do not stage, do not commit.

